  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of data collection on fisheries and aquaculture production: pilot system for the Yangon Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objectives include:
Development: better knowledge of the exploitation of fisheries resources and livelihoods of fishing communities, contributing to a more sustainable development of fisheries for food security and poverty alleviation.
Medium term: decision making on management, planning fisheries development and national policy on food security and poverty reduction in fishing communities will be based on timely information.
Long term: regular provision of reliable information that would allow the sustainable management and development of fisheries resources.</narrative>
  </description>
